# Git LFS Configuration for PDF Test Fixtures
# 
# PDF files are stored using Git LFS to keep repository size manageable.
# Ensure you have git-lfs installed: https://git-lfs.github.com/

# Exclude all PDF files from standard git tracking
*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Exclude metadata files if they reference binary content
*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# But do track metadata JSON and documentation
!*.metadata.json
!*.md
!INVENTORY.md
